{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y2XCdNkfbm3t5dz5QLDyMm","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_10/projects/provenance_weight_training/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# provenance_weight_training — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 17:22 UTC | 更新原因: 修正 GPU 预算（18h→70-85h，第三次被 Reviewer flag）；更新 seed42 进度（b=2.0 DONE, b=3.0~70%）；D017 勘误引用\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n基于收敛理论的自适应污染重加权：用检测器置信度估计 α_eff(b)，推导理论最优权重指数 b*，替代启发式网格搜索。详见 IDEA_BRIEF.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: MVP 验证中（Day 2/12）\\\\n- **投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25（主攻）| AAAI 2027 后备\\\\n- **数据**: 132M tokens 合成数据已生成（datagen_synthetic_4gpu DONE）\\\\n- **检测器**: TF-IDF bigrams + LR（AUC=0.939, ECE=0.048, gate PASS）。ModernBERT 废弃（AUC 过高致 q-score 极化，D005-D008）\\\\n- **Uniform baselines**: 3 seeds 全 DONE（seed42=17.69, seed123=17.69, seed456=17.70）\\\\n- **Grid-b seed123**: 6 值全 DONE。b=0.5 best（17.638），单调递增，改善 uniform 0.29%\\\\n- **Grid-b seed42**: batch job RUNNING（b=0.5/1.0/1.5/2.0 DONE，b=3.0~70%，b=5.0 待跑）\\\\n- **Grid-b seed456**: 全 6 值 QUEUED\\\\n- **Adaptive (原版 n_min=3)**: 3 seeds DONE，seed42 零改善（D011 诊断为 n_min=3 钳制 ESS）\\\\n- **Adaptive_fix (D012 修复版)**: n_min=2，无 EMA（D017 勘误确认）。3 seeds RUNNING\\\\n- **MVP 判定**: BLOCKED → 等 adaptive_fix 三组 + grid-b seed42 完成后重新评估\\\\n\\\\n## 关键数据汇总\\\\n\\\\n### Grid-b eval_ppl（seed123，全 6 值）\\\\n| b | eval_ppl | vs uniform |\\\\n|---|----------|-----------|\\\\n| 0.5 | 17.638 | -0.29% ★ |\\\\n| 1.0 | 17.674 | -0.09% |\\\\n| 1.5 | 17.701 | +0.06% |\\\\n| 2.0 | 17.725 | +0.20% |\\\\n| 3.0 | 17.760 | +0.41% |\\\\n| 5.0 | 17.804 | +0.67% |\\\\n\\\\n**信号**: b 单调递增，最优在搜索空间边界（b=0.5）。可能需要扩展到 b<0.5。\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] adaptive_fix 三组完成 → 收集 eval_ppl + b* 轨迹\\\\n- [ ] grid_b seed42 batch 完成 → 汇总 6 值，确认 seed42 best-b\\\\n- [ ] 上述两项就绪 → MVP PASS/FAIL 判定（adaptive_fix 均值 ≥ 90% grid-best 改善量）\\\\n- [ ] 若 seed42/seed123 best-b 均在边界(0.5) → 考虑扩展 grid 到 b=0.1/0.2/0.3\\\\n- [ ] MVP PASS → post-mvp-kickoff（paper_framing → experiment_plan → dream_simulate）\\\\n- [ ] seed456 grid-b 系列补齐 3-seed 统计（adaptive_fix 之后排队）\\\\n\\\\n## 12 天排期（EMNLP ARR May 25）\\\\n| 阶段 | 天数 | 内容 | 状态 |\\\\n|------|------|------|------|\\\\n| 代码+环境+数据生成 | Day 1 | 代码框架、服务器搭建、132M tokens 生成 | ✅ DONE |\\\\n| 检测器+MVP | Day 1-3 | TF-IDF 检测器(DONE) + grid-b/adaptive 对比 | 🔄 进行中 |\\\\n| 全实验矩阵 | Day 3-7 | 3 污染比例 × 3 方法 × 2+ 生成器 + ablation | ⏳ 待 MVP |\\\\n| 论文写作 | Day 7-10 | Paper Agent 全流程 | ⏳ |\\\\n| 迭代+提交 | Day 10-12 | Review 对抗 + 最终提交 | ⏳ |\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n分配: 4× RTX 6000 Pro 96G (westd-47453, cuda:0-3)\\\\n已消耗: ~58+ GPU-hours（15 DONE + 4 RUNNING）\\\\nMVP 预算: ~70-85 GPU-hours（修正自原 18h 估计）\\\\nFull: ~180 GPU-hours\\\\n硬约束: 输出目录必须在数据盘（根分区 30GB，D008 教训）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D019 | 2026-05-15 | MVP PASS (Path B): aggregate ratio 88.6% < 90% 但定性 | adaptive_fix_seed42, adaptive_fix_seed123, adaptive_fix_seed456, grid_b0_5_seed456 |\\\\n| D018 | 2026-05-14 | 撤回 D016 warning：v1→v2 无混淆变量，唯一差异为 n_min(3→2)。78% b | adaptive_fix_seed42, adaptive_fix_seed123, adaptive_fix_seed456 |\\\\n| D017 | 2026-05-14 | D012 勘误：实际实施为 n_min=2 无 EMA（EMA 未编码），D012 原文\\\\\\\"EMA 平 | adaptive_fix_seed42, adaptive_fix_seed123, adaptive_fix_seed456 |\\\\n| D016 | 2026-05-14 | Reviewer warning: v1→v2 可能存在混淆变量（n_min + early ret | adaptive_fix_seed42, adaptive_fix_seed123, adaptive_fix_seed456 |\\\\n| D015 | 2026-05-14 | b* 极端值评估：ceiling hit 0.3% 不阻塞 MVP，batch_size=4 为 l | adaptive_fix_seed42, adaptive_fix_seed456 |\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-14 | Framing 精炼：Path B 默认、Claim 2 待 ablation 升级、MVP 增加  | — |\\\\n| D013 | 2026-05-14 | 新颖性自查：Drayson et al. (EMNLP 2025) 使用同一公式 w=(1-q)^b | — |\\\\n| D012 | 2026-05-14 | 修复 adaptive 算法：n_min 降至 2 + EMA 平滑 b*，重跑 3 seeds | adaptive_seed42, adaptive_seed123, adaptive_seed456 |\\\\n| D011 | 2026-05-14 | 暂缓 MVP PASS 判定：seed42 adaptive 零改善，需诊断后重新评估 | adaptive_seed42, adaptive_seed123, adaptive_seed456 |\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-14 | cuda:3 双进程冲突：kill 旧进程 PID 92798，保留新进程 PID 94717 | grid_b5_0_seed123 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3532, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XTFXWJ17ucgV9rhcawcSwM","session_id":"5659f699-0e1d-4903-a3c6-9903938af801","uuid":"0c90bbaa-d98b-4086-b3b8-4c2a18360715","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:21:37.006Z"}
