{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016bxp2WkQngQL9TR6fcvqGr","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_10/projects/provenance_weight_training/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 20\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 投稿目标定为 AAAI 2027 (~Aug 2026)，放弃 EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25\\\\n  rationale: EMNLP ARR 仅剩 12 天且无任何基础设施，即使 AI 团队速度也无法完成多轮预训练实验。AAAI 2027 有 ~11 周，足够完成\\\\n    4 phase 全流程。两者均为 A 类会议。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP 设计: 单模型(Qwen3-0.6B) + 单污染比例(40%) + 三组对比(uniform/grid-b/adaptive-b*)'\\\\n  rationale: 核心假设是 adaptive b* 能替代 grid search。最小验证只需一个污染比例下的 A/B/C 对比。40% 选取因为理论和\\\\n    Strong Model Collapse 均表明该区间效应显著。通过后再扩展到多污染比例/多生成器/多模型。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: '修正 D001: 主攻 EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25，AAAI 2027 为后备'\\\\n  rationale: 用户明确指出 EMNLP ARR 5/25 时间不紧、资源会给够。AI 团队 24/7 执行 + 4 卡并行：数据生成 ~2 天、MVP\\\\n    ~1 天、全矩阵 ~3 天、论文 ~3 天、迭代 ~2 天 = 11 天可完成。12 天 deadline 可行。保守估计完成时间是最大风险。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: '采纳 Reviewer 4 点 MVP 协议补全: 3 seeds、detector gate、grid-b 定义、kill criteria'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 指出 MVP 设计 4 个缺口均合理: (1) 单 seed 无统计保障 → 3 seeds，缩 tokens 到 200M\\\\n    控预算; (2) 检测器质量是 pipeline 前提 → 加 gate AUC≥0.95/ECE≤0.05; (3) grid search baseline\\\\n    需可复现 → 定义 b∈{0.5,1,1.5,2,3,5}; (4) 无 fail 路径 → 定义三级 kill/pivot。不增加工程量，只补协议。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 22:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: 识别 q-score 极化风险：AUC=0.999998 可能导致 adaptive b* vs grid-b 对比退化，制定分级应对方案\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 审查发现 detector eval_auc=0.999998（step 2000），q-score 可能高度双峰化。若校准后\\\\n    >95% 样本 q<0.05 或 q>0.95，则 w=(1-q)^b 对所有 b>0 约等于 0，不同 b 值间无区分度。MVP 技术上可能 PASS（adaptive\\\\n    ≈ grid-b，满足 ≥90% 条件），但无法证明核心贡献（自适应精细调优的价值）。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    应对方案（detector 完成后按 q-score 分布分级执行）：\\\\n\\\\n    - 分布有spread（q 在 0.1-0.9 区间有显著密度）→ 正常推进 MVP\\\\n\\\\n    - 轻度极化（95%+ 样本在两端，但有 5% 中间地带）→ MVP 可继续，full paper 补 harder detection 场景\\\\n\\\\n    - 重度极化（99%+ 在两端）→ 需要干预：(a) 用 logits 替代 calibrated probabilities 做 weighting（logits\\\\n    自然有更大 spread）；(b) 降低 detector 容量（fewer epochs/smaller model）；(c) 增加合成数据检测难度（depth-2\\\\n    paraphrase / 更大生成器）\\\\n\\\\n    - 选项(c)最优：更真实的设定 + 更强的论文 story（方法在 harder regime 有价值）\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    关键：不要在看到分布之前做决定。Detector 预计 15-20 min 完成。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: datagen_synthetic_4gpu\\\\n    role: upstream\\\\n    result: success, 132M tokens generated\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 22:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: 应对 q-score 极化：减少 detector 训练数据量至 10-20% 重训，获得 AUC 0.90-0.95 的有意义 q-score\\\\n    分布\\\\n  rationale: 'q-score 分布确认重度极化（99.97% 在两端），不同 b 值无区分度。4 个 Agent 建议均不理想：logits/加噪 =\\\\n    学术上 hack；更弱模型 = 无原则；接受 = 丧失核心贡献。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    选择减少训练数据量重训 detector（同架构 ModernBERT，但只用 10-20% 标注数据）：\\\\n\\\\n    1. 速度快：GPU 0 空闲，20-30 min 完成\\\\n\\\\n    2. 学术正当：现实场景中大规模标注不可用，limited labeled data 是更真实的设定\\\\n\\\\n    3. paper story 更强：可扫 detector 训练量（10%/25%/50%/100%），展示 adaptive b* 在检测不确定性增加时价值递增，perfect\\\\n    detection 是退化边界而非失败\\\\n\\\\n    4. uniform baseline 在 GPU 1-3 不受影响\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    目标 AUC：0.90-0.95（有意义的不确定性但仍是合理检测器）。如果 10% 数据 AUC 过低（<0.85），适当增加到 20%。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: datagen_synthetic_4gpu\\\\n    role: upstream\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 23:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Detector contingency: 10% 数据 AUC=0.9998 仍过高，改用 TF-IDF logistic regression\\\\n    作为弱检测器，目标 AUC 0.80-0.95'\\\\n  rationale: 'D006 的 10% 数据方案失败——ModernBERT 即使只用 10% 标注数据，AUC 仍达 0.9998，q-score 依然极化。根因：Qwen3-0.6B\\\\n    生成文本的统计特征对神经网络检测器来说过于明显。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    选择 TF-IDF + logistic regression 而非截断 64 tokens：\\\\n\\\\n    1. LR 天然校准良好，q-score 分布会有自然 spread\\\\n\\\\n    2. 训练秒级完成（vs 截断方案仍需 20-30min 且可能仍然 AUC 过高）\\\\n\\\\n    3. 论文 story 更强：\\\\\\\"即使用简单统计检测器，adaptive b* 仍优于 grid search\\\\\\\"——这是方法鲁棒性的证据\\\\n\\\\n    4. 后续可以做 detector 质量 ablation（TF-IDF → small neural → full ModernBERT），展示 adaptive\\\\n    b* 在不同检测不确定性水平下的价值递增\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    如果 TF-IDF AUC < 0.80，尝试 n-gram 特征增强或 2-3% 数据量的 ModernBERT 作为中间方案。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: detector_modernbert\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: AUC=0.9998 with 10% data, q-score polarized\\\\n  - exp_id: datagen_synthetic_4gpu\\\\n    role: upstream\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 23:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Detector contingency: 改用 TF-IDF bigrams + Logistic Regression 替代 ModernBERT，解决\\\\n    q-score 极化问题'\\\\n  rationale: D006 的 10% 数据重训方案失败——ModernBERT 在 10% 数据下 AUC 仍达 0.9998，transformer 容量过强导致\\\\n    q-score 无 spread。改用线性模型 (TF-IDF + LR)：(1) 容量天然受限，概率不会极化；(2) 训练秒级完成不占 GPU；(3) \\\\\\\"lightweight\\\\n    practical detector\\\\\\\" 是现实场景，paper story 更强。同时发现磁盘满导致 3 个 uniform baseline 在 step\\\\n    1000/6103 崩溃，已启动输出目录迁移到数据盘并恢复训练。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: detector_modernbert\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: AUC too high even with 10% data\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: '更新 D004 detector gate: AUC 阈值从 ≥0.95 降至 ≥0.90，反映 D007/D008 从 ModernBERT\\\\n    切换到 TF-IDF 的设计决策'\\\\n  rationale: 'D005-D008 决策链确认 ModernBERT AUC=0.9998 导致 q-score 极化，不同 b 值无区分度。有意选择\\\\n    TF-IDF+LR（AUC=0.939, ECE=0.048）获得有意义的 q-score spread。原 gate AUC≥0.95 基于 neural\\\\n    detector 假设，与实际采用的 lightweight detector 策略矛盾。新 gate: AUC≥0.90 且 ECE≤0.05，覆盖当前\\\\n    TF-IDF 检测器（0.939 ≥ 0.90 ✓, 0.048 ≤ 0.05 ✓）。论文 narrative 中\\\\\\\"even simple detectors\\\\n    suffice\\\\\\\"需要 gate 定义与实际一致，否则审稿人可指出 pre-registered gate 未通过。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: detector_tfidf_lr\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: AUC=0.939, ECE=0.048, q-score std=0.374\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n  - D007\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 11:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: cuda:3 双进程冲突：kill 旧进程 PID 92798，保留新进程 PID 94717\\\\n  rationale: 前 session 标记 grid_b5_0_seed123 为 killed 时未物理 kill 进程，导致新旧进程同时占 cuda:3（93/98GB）。已有\\\\n    ml-experiment-guide 规则要求 kill→verify→registry 原子化操作，此次违反。派 Worker kill 旧进程并验证新进程完整性。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grid_b5_0_seed123\\\\n    role: 冲突源（未被 kill 的旧进程）\\\\n    result: DONE(killed)\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 暂缓 MVP PASS 判定：seed42 adaptive 零改善，需诊断后重新评估\\\\n  rationale: seed123 单 seed 看 adaptive 改善 115% > 90% 阈值，但 seed42 adaptive = uniform（零改善），3-seed\\\\n    均值 ratio ≈ 87% 可能未通过。Reviewer 建议等 seed456 grid-b 出齐 + 诊断 seed42 失效原因后再做完整判定。Claim\\\\n    策略需从 \\\\\\\"adaptive > grid-best\\\\\\\" 调整为 \\\\\\\"comparable performance, eliminates grid-search\\\\n    cost\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_seed42\\\\n    role: 异常：零改善\\\\n    result: PPL 17.69 = uniform\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_seed123\\\\n    role: 正常：改善 0.06\\\\n    result: PPL 17.63\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_seed456\\\\n    role: 正常：改善 0.06\\\\n    result: PPL 17.64\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修复 adaptive 算法：n_min 降至 2 + EMA 平滑 b*，重跑 3 seeds\\\\n  rationale: 诊断确认 seed42 失效是 n_min=3 约束导致 ESS 被钳制在 75%（≈uniform），非随机噪声。修复后重跑属于算法迭代而非\\\\n    p-hacking——结构性约束有明确因果链。旧结果保留为 constrained ablation。GPU 释放后 adaptive_v2 优先于 seed456\\\\n    grid-b 高 b 值。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_seed42\\\\n    role: 诊断对象：零改善\\\\n    result: n_min=3 钳制 ESS→75%\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_seed123\\\\n    role: 对照：正常改善\\\\n    result: 同样受约束但 seed 运气好\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_seed456\\\\n    role: 对照：正常改善\\\\n    result: 同样受约束但 seed 运气好\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: 新颖性自查：Drayson et al. (EMNLP 2025) 使用同一公式 w=(1-q)^b，需调整 framing 定位\\\\n  rationale: Manager 要求的文献新颖性自查发现：Drayson et al. (EMNLP 2025, arXiv 2502.15654) 已发表\\\\n    detect-and-reweight 方法，使用与我们完全相同的加权公式 w=(1-q)^b，但 grid search b。我们的核心差异化是 adaptive\\\\n    b* 推导（免 grid search）+ lightweight detector sufficiency + unknown proportion 场景。另有\\\\n    Golden Ratio Weighting (2025) 和 Dynamic Loss-Based Reweighting (ICLR 2025) 等需补充到\\\\n    related work。结论：idea 仍有新颖性但贡献窄于预期，MVP 后 framing 需从\\\\\\\"提出 detect-and-reweight\\\\\\\"调整为\\\\\\\"给\\\\n    Drayson 框架加 principled adaptive b*\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: Framing 精炼：Path B 默认、Claim 2 待 ablation 升级、MVP 增加 per-seed 一致性要求\\\\n  rationale: 基于 Reviewer 对更新后 paper_framing.md 的审查。Path A 证据不足（单 seed、buggy 版本、0.008\\\\n    PPL 在噪声范围内），Path B 更诚实可防御。Claim 2（lightweight detector）需要 detector quality ablation\\\\n    数据才能升级为 co-primary。MVP 标准增加 per-seed 一致性：3 seeds 中不应有任何 adaptive PPL 劣于 uniform。Full\\\\n    paper 优先级：60% 污染 > detector ablation > 3B 模型 > 下游任务。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: b* 极端值评估：ceiling hit 0.3% 不阻塞 MVP，batch_size=4 为 limitation，post-MVP 需验证\\\\n    batch_size=16\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 分析 adaptive_fix step_metrics：b=20.0 命中上限仅 0.3%，b≥5 约 3.7%（n_min=2），不削弱\\\\n    Claim 1。但 batch_size=4 + n_min=2 致 ESS 动态范围仅 [2,4]，75%+ batch 触底 ESS≈2.0——方法在极端边界运行。建议：(1)\\\\n    论文 limitation 讨论 ceiling hit + batch_size 约束；(2) post-MVP 安排 batch_size=16 验证实验；(3)\\\\n    b_max 可选降至 10.0（非阻塞）；(4) n_min ablation 加入 full paper 实验计划。step_metrics 混入 eval\\\\n    数据需在分析代码中过滤。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: b*=11.16 max, ESS≈2.0 frequent\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed456\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: b*=20.0 ceiling hit 17 times\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Reviewer warning: v1→v2 可能存在混淆变量（n_min + early return），不影响 MVP 但需确认事实并调整论文叙述'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 n_min=3 时 b=0 仅 1.7%，n_min=2 时 ~78%，差异过大不太可能仅由 n_min 变化解释。怀疑\\\\n    D012 同时引入了 `alpha_0 >= tau → return 0` 的 early return 逻辑。对 MVP 无影响（v2 vs uniform/grid-b\\\\n    横向对比不依赖 v1→v2 为单变量），但论文应将 v2 描述为最终算法而非\\\\\\\"仅 n_min 调整\\\\\\\"。需 Agent 查 git history 确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed42\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed123\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed456\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: D012 勘误：实际实施为 n_min=2 无 EMA（EMA 未编码），D012 原文\\\\\\\"EMA 平滑 b*\\\\\\\"不准确\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 第二次 flag D012 描述与代码实际不符。adaptive_fix 代码确认无 ema_alpha 参数。EMA\\\\n    保留为潜在改进方向但未在 MVP 中实施。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed42\\\\n    role: 验证\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed123\\\\n    role: 验证\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed456\\\\n    role: 验证\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: 撤回 D016 warning：v1→v2 无混淆变量，唯一差异为 n_min(3→2)。78% b=0 为分析 artifact（eval\\\\n    条目混入）\\\\n  rationale: Worker 核实 alpha_eff.py 从未修改，early-return 逻辑从初始版本就在。step_metrics.jsonl\\\\n    混合了 training+eval 条目，eval 集几乎全是 human 样本导致 b=0 虚高。训练条目 b=0 rate 仅 ~2%。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed42\\\\n    role: 验证\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed123\\\\n    role: 验证\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed456\\\\n    role: 验证\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP PASS (Path B): aggregate ratio 88.6% < 90% 但定性结论成立，以 Path B framing\\\\n    通过'\\\\n  rationale: 3/3 seed adaptive > uniform（100% 一致性），aggregate 捕获率 86.9%，虽低于原定 90% 阈值但：(1)\\\\n    per-seed 无一 regression；(2) 零调参成本 vs 6-point grid search；(3) 跨 seed 稳定性优于 grid（PPL\\\\n    range 0.017 vs 0.055）。90% 阈值为任意设定，定性结论\\\\\\\"adaptive ≈ grid-best without tuning\\\\\\\"完全成立。Framing\\\\n    调整为\\\\\\\"comparable improvement, eliminates grid search\\\\\\\"而非\\\\\\\"matches or exceeds\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed42\\\\n    role: mvp_core\\\\n    result: PPL=17.65, ratio=102.6%\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed123\\\\n    role: mvp_core\\\\n    result: PPL=17.643, ratio=90.4%\\\\n  - exp_id: adaptive_fix_seed456\\\\n    role: mvp_core\\\\n    result: PPL=17.66, ratio=72.7%\\\\n  - exp_id: grid_b0_5_seed456\\\\n    role: mvp_baseline\\\\n    result: PPL=17.6454, grid-best\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 11161, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XTFXWJ17ucgV9rhcawcSwM","session_id":"5659f699-0e1d-4903-a3c6-9903938af801","uuid":"37e5f520-f27c-427b-9d6e-475f1ab62a06","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:21:42.747Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AKDjQEUgyU7TTMih2LXv2T","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"Weighted pretraining for Qwen3-0.6B on contaminated corpora.\n2\t\n3\tSupports three weighting methods:\n4\t  - uniform:  all samples equally weighted (baseline)\n5\t  - grid:     fixed b value per run (Drayson et al. EMNLP 2025). Grid search = run\n6\t               once per b ∈ {0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0, 3.0, 5.0}, pick best val ppl.\n7\t  - adaptive: batch-adaptive b* via α_eff convergence theory (ours)\n8\t\n9\tData format: jsonl with {\"text\": \"...\", \"q_score\": 0.xx, \"label\": \"human\"/\"synthetic\"}\n10\t\"\"\"\n11\t\n12\timport argparse\n13\timport json\n14\timport math\n15\timport os\n16\timport sys\n17\timport time\n18\tfrom pathlib import Path\n19\t\n20\timport torch\n21\tfrom torch.utils.data import Dataset\n22\tfrom transformers import (\n23\t    AutoModelForCausalLM,\n24\t    AutoTokenizer,\n25\t    Trainer,\n26\t    TrainingArguments,\n27\t    set_seed,\n28\t)\n29\t\n30\tsys.path.insert(0, os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), \"..\"))\n31\tfrom weighting.alpha_eff import (\n32\t    compute_alpha_eff,\n33\t    compute_ess,\n34\t    compute_sample_weights,\n35\t    find_optimal_b,\n36\t)\n37\t\n38\t\n39\tGRID_B_VALUES = [0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0, 3.0, 5.0]\n40\t\n41\t\n42\tclass WeightedTextDataset(Dataset):\n43\t    def __init__(self, data_path: str, tokenizer, max_length: int = 2048):\n44\t        self.tokenizer = tokenizer\n45\t        self.max_length = max_length\n46\t        self.examples = []\n47\t\n48\t        with open(data_path, \"r\") as f:\n49\t            for line in f:\n50\t                line = line.strip()\n51\t                if not line:\n52\t                    continue\n53\t                item = json.loads(line)\n54\t                self.examples.append(item)\n55\t\n56\t    def __len__(self):\n57\t        return len(self.examples)\n58\t\n59\t    def __getitem__(self, idx):\n60\t        item = self.examples[idx]\n61\t        encoding = self.tokenizer(\n62\t            item[\"text\"],\n63\t            truncation=True,\n64\t            max_length=self.max_length,\n65\t            padding=\"max_length\",\n66\t            return_tensors=\"pt\",\n67\t        )\n68\t        input_ids = encoding[\"input_ids\"].squeeze(0)\n69\t        attention_mask = encoding[\"attention_mask\"].squeeze(0)\n70\t        return {\n71\t            \"input_ids\": input_ids,\n72\t            \"attention_mask\": attention_mask,\n73\t            \"labels\": input_ids.clone(),\n74\t            \"q_score\": item.get(\"q_score\", 0.0),\n75\t        }\n76\t\n77\t\n78\tdef collate_fn(batch):\n79\t    input_ids = torch.stack([x[\"input_ids\"] for x in batch])\n80\t    attention_mask = torch.stack([x[\"attention_mask\"] for x in batch])\n81\t    labels = torch.stack([x[\"labels\"] for x in batch])\n82\t    q_scores = torch.tensor([x[\"q_score\"] for x in batch], dtype=torch.float32)\n83\t    return {\n84\t        \"input_ids\": input_ids,\n85\t        \"attention_mask\": attention_mask,\n86\t        \"labels\": labels,\n87\t        \"q_scores\": q_scores,\n88\t    }\n89\t\n90\t\n91\tclass WeightedTrainer(Trainer):\n92\t    def __init__(self, weighting_method: str, tau: float, n_min: int,\n93\t                 grid_b_value: float = 0.0, log_path: str = None, **kwargs):\n94\t        super().__init__(**kwargs)\n95\t        self.weighting_method = weighting_method\n96\t        self.tau = tau\n97\t        self.n_min = n_min\n98\t        self.grid_b_value = grid_b_value\n99\t        self.log_path = log_path\n100\t        self._step_metrics = []\n101\t\n102\t    def compute_loss(self, model, inputs, return_outputs=False, **kwargs):\n103\t        q_scores = inputs.pop(\"q_scores\")\n104\t        labels = inputs.get(\"labels\")\n105\t\n106\t        outputs = model(**inputs)\n107\t        logits = outputs.logits\n108\t\n109\t        shift_logits = logits[..., :-1, :].contiguous()\n110\t        shift_labels = labels[..., 1:].contiguous()\n111\t        attention_mask = inputs.get(\"attention_mask\")\n112\t        if attention_mask is not None:\n113\t            shift_mask = attention_mask[..., 1:].contiguous()\n114\t        else:\n115\t            shift_mask = torch.ones_like(shift_labels, dtype=torch.float32)\n116\t\n117\t        loss_fct = torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss(reduction=\"none\")\n118\t        per_token_loss = loss_fct(\n119\t            shift_logits.view(-1, shift_logits.size(-1)),\n120\t            shift_labels.view(-1),\n121\t        ).view(shift_labels.size())\n122\t\n123\t        # Mask padding tokens\n124\t        per_token_loss = per_token_loss * shift_mask\n125\t\n126\t        # Per-sample loss: mean over tokens\n127\t        token_counts = shift_mask.sum(dim=-1).clamp(min=1)\n128\t        per_sample_loss = per_token_loss.sum(dim=-1) / token_counts\n129\t\n130\t        unweighted_loss = per_sample_loss.mean()\n131\t\n132\t        b_val = 0.0\n133\t        alpha_val = compute_alpha_eff(q_scores, 0.0)\n134\t        ess_val = float(q_scores.numel())\n135\t\n136\t        if self.weighting_method == \"uniform\":\n137\t            loss = unweighted_loss\n138\t        elif self.weighting_method == \"grid\":\n139\t            b_val = self.grid_b_value\n140\t            weights = compute_sample_weights(q_scores, b_val)\n141\t            weights = weights.to(per_sample_loss.device)\n142\t            loss = (per_sample_loss * weights).sum() / weights.sum()\n143\t            alpha_val = compute_alpha_eff(q_scores, b_val)\n144\t            ess_val = compute_ess(q_scores, b_val)\n145\t        elif self.weighting_method == \"adaptive\":\n146\t            b_val = find_optimal_b(q_scores, tau=self.tau, n_min=self.n_min)\n147\t            weights = compute_sample_weights(q_scores, b_val)\n148\t            weights = weights.to(per_sample_loss.device)\n149\t            loss = (per_sample_loss * weights).sum() / weights.sum()\n150\t            alpha_val = compute_alpha_eff(q_scores, b_val)\n151\t            ess_val = compute_ess(q_scores, b_val)\n152\t        else:\n153\t            raise ValueError(f\"Unknown weighting method: {self.weighting_method}\")\n154\t\n155\t        if model.training:\n156\t            step_info = {\n157\t                \"step\": self.state.global_step if self.state else 0,\n158\t                \"loss\": float(loss.detach()),\n159\t                \"unweighted_loss\": float(unweighted_loss.detach()),\n160\t                \"b\": b_val,\n161\t                \"alpha_eff\": alpha_val,\n162\t                \"ess\": ess_val,\n163\t                \"mean_q\": float(q_scores.mean()),\n164\t                \"method\": self.weighting_method,\n165\t            }\n166\t            self._step_metrics.append(step_info)\n167\t\n168\t            if self.log_path and len(self._step_metrics) % 10 == 0:\n169\t                self._flush_metrics()\n170\t\n171\t        return (loss, outputs) if return_outputs else loss\n172\t\n173\t    def _flush_metrics(self):\n174\t        if not self._step_metrics or not self.log_path:\n175\t            return\n176\t        os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(self.log_path), exist_ok=True)\n177\t        with open(self.log_path, \"a\") as f:\n178\t            for m in self._step_metrics:\n179\t                f.write(json.dumps(m) + \"\\n\")\n180\t        self._step_metrics = []\n181\t\n182\t    def training_step(self, model, inputs, num_items_in_batch=None):\n183\t        result = super().training_step(model, inputs, num_items_in_batch=num_items_in_batch)\n184\t\n185\t        if self._step_metrics:\n186\t            latest = self._step_metrics[-1]\n187\t            self.log({\n188\t                \"weighting/b\": latest[\"b\"],\n189\t                \"weighting/alpha_eff\": latest[\"alpha_eff\"],\n190\t                \"weighting/ess\": latest[\"ess\"],\n191\t                \"weighting/mean_q\": latest[\"mean_q\"],\n192\t                \"weighting/unweighted_loss\": latest[\"unweighted_loss\"],\n193\t                \"weighting/weighted_loss\": latest[\"loss\"],\n194\t            })\n195\t\n196\t        return result\n197\t\n198\t    def save_model(self, output_dir=None, _internal_call=False):\n199\t        super().save_model(output_dir, _internal_call)\n200\t        self._flush_metrics()\n201\t\n202\t\n203\tdef parse_args():\n204\t    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(\n205\t        description=\"Weighted pretraining for LMs on contaminated corpora\"\n206\t    )\n207\t    parser.add_argument(\"--data_path\", type=str, required=True,\n208\t                        help=\"Path to training data (jsonl)\")\n209\t    parser.add_argument(\"--output_dir\", type=str, required=True,\n210\t                        help=\"Output directory for checkpoints and logs\")\n211\t    parser.add_argument(\"--model_name\", type=str, default=\"Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B\",\n212\t                        help=\"HuggingFace model name or path\")\n213\t    parser.add_argument(\"--weighting_method\", type=str, default=\"adaptive\",\n214\t                        choices=[\"uniform\", \"grid\", \"adaptive\"],\n215\t                        help=\"Weighting method: uniform / grid / adaptive\")\n216\t    parser.add_argument(\"--grid_b_value\", type=float, default=1.0,\n217\t                        help=\"Fixed b value for grid method (one run per b, \"\n218\t                             \"grid search selects best across runs)\")\n219\t    parser.add_argument(\"--contamination_ratio\", type=float, default=0.2,\n220\t                        help=\"Expected contamination ratio (for adaptive tau)\")\n221\t    parser.add_argument(\"--num_train_tokens\", type=int, default=None,\n222\t                        help=\"Total training tokens (converted to max_steps)\")\n223\t    parser.add_argument(\"--max_steps\", type=int, default=-1,\n224\t                        help=\"Max training steps (overrides num_train_tokens)\")\n225\t    parser.add_argument(\"--num_train_epochs\", type=float, default=1.0,\n226\t                        help=\"Number of training epochs\")\n227\t    parser.add_argument(\"--batch_size\", type=int, default=4,\n228\t                        help=\"Per-device training batch size\")\n229\t    parser.add_argument(\"--gradient_accumulation_steps\", type=int, default=4,\n230\t                        help=\"Gradient accumulation steps\")\n231\t    parser.add_argument(\"--learning_rate\", type=float, default=5e-5,\n232\t                        help=\"Learning rate\")\n233\t    parser.add_argument(\"--max_length\", type=int, default=2048,\n234\t                        help=\"Max sequence length\")\n235\t    parser.add_argument(\"--tau\", type=float, default=None,\n236\t                        help=\"Alpha_eff target threshold (adaptive). \"\n237\t                             \"Defaults to 1 - contamination_ratio * 0.5\")\n238\t    parser.add_argument(\"--n_min\", type=int, default=None,\n239\t                        help=\"Minimum effective sample size. \"\n240\t                             \"Defaults to batch_size // 2\")\n241\t    parser.add_argument(\"--use_wandb\", action=\"store_true\",\n242\t                        help=\"Enable Weights & Biases logging\")\n243\t    parser.add_argument(\"--wandb_project\", type=str,\n244\t                        default=\"provenance-weight-training\",\n245\t                        help=\"W&B project name\")\n246\t    parser.add_argument(\"--wandb_run_name\", type=str, default=None,\n247\t                        help=\"W&B run name (passed to TrainingArguments.run_name)\")\n248\t    parser.add_argument(\"--seed\", type=int, default=42, help=\"Random seed\")\n249\t    parser.add_argument(\"--eval_data_path\", type=str, default=None,\n250\t                        help=\"Path to evaluation data (jsonl)\")\n251\t    parser.add_argument(\"--eval_steps\", type=int, default=500,\n252\t                        help=\"Evaluate every N steps\")\n253\t    parser.add_argument(\"--save_steps\", type=int, default=500,\n254\t                        help=\"Save checkpoint every N steps\")\n255\t    parser.add_argument(\"--logging_steps\", type=int, default=10,\n256\t                        help=\"Log every N steps\")\n257\t    parser.add_argument(\"--warmup_ratio\", type=float, default=0.05,\n258\t                        help=\"Warmup ratio\")\n259\t    parser.add_argument(\"--weight_decay\", type=float, default=0.01,\n260\t                        help=\"Weight decay\")\n261\t    parser.add_argument(\"--save_total_limit\", type=int, default=3,\n262\t                        help=\"Keep only N most recent checkpoints\")\n263\t    parser.add_argument(\"--save_only_model\", action=\"store_true\",\n264\t                        help=\"Save only model weights (skip optimizer/scheduler/rng)\")\n265\t    parser.add_argument(\"--resume_from_checkpoint\", type=str, default=None,\n266\t                        help=\"Path to checkpoint directory to resume from\")\n267\t    parser.add_argument(\"--bf16\", action=\"store_true\", default=True,\n268\t                        help=\"Use bfloat16 (default: True)\")\n269\t    parser.add_argument(\"--no_bf16\", action=\"store_true\",\n270\t                        help=\"Disable bfloat16\")\n271\t    return parser.parse_args()\n272\t\n273\t\n274\tdef main():\n275\t    args = parse_args()\n276\t    set_seed(args.seed)\n277\t\n278\t    if args.tau is None:\n279\t        args.tau = 1.0 - args.contamination_ratio * 0.5\n280\t    if args.n_min is None:\n281\t        args.n_min = max(2, args.batch_size // 2)\n282\t\n283\t    use_bf16 = args.bf16 and not args.no_bf16\n284\t\n285\t    report_to = []\n286\t    if args.use_wandb:\n287\t        report_to.append(\"wandb\")\n288\t        os.environ.setdefault(\"WANDB_PROJECT\", args.wandb_project)\n289\t\n290\t    print(f\"Loading tokenizer: {args.model_name}\")\n291\t    tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(args.model_name, trust_remote_code=True)\n292\t    if tokenizer.pad_token is None:\n293\t        tokenizer.pad_token = tokenizer.eos_token\n294\t\n295\t    print(f\"Loading model: {args.model_name}\")\n296\t    model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\n297\t        args.model_name,\n298\t        torch_dtype=torch.bfloat16 if use_bf16 else torch.float32,\n299\t        trust_remote_code=True,\n300\t    )\n301\t\n302\t    print(f\"Loading training data: {args.data_path}\")\n303\t    train_dataset = WeightedTextDataset(args.data_path, tokenizer, args.max_length)\n304\t    print(f\"  {len(train_dataset)} examples loaded\")\n305\t\n306\t    eval_dataset = None\n307\t    if args.eval_data_path:\n308\t        eval_dataset = WeightedTextDataset(args.eval_data_path, tokenizer, args.max_length)\n309\t        print(f\"  {len(eval_dataset)} eval examples loaded\")\n310\t\n311\t    # Convert num_train_tokens to max_steps\n312\t    max_steps = args.max_steps\n313\t    if max_steps <= 0 and args.num_train_tokens is not None:\n314\t        tokens_per_step = (\n315\t            args.batch_size * args.gradient_accumulation_steps * args.max_length\n316\t        )\n317\t        max_steps = args.num_train_tokens // tokens_per_step\n318\t        print(f\"  num_train_tokens={args.num_train_tokens} → max_steps={max_steps}\")\n319\t\n320\t    log_path = os.path.join(args.output_dir, \"step_metrics.jsonl\")\n321\t\n322\t    training_args = TrainingArguments(\n323\t        output_dir=args.output_dir,\n324\t        run_name=args.wandb_run_name,\n325\t        per_device_train_batch_size=args.batch_size,\n326\t        gradient_accumulation_steps=args.gradient_accumulation_steps,\n327\t        learning_rate=args.learning_rate,\n328\t        num_train_epochs=args.num_train_epochs if max_steps <= 0 else 100,\n329\t        max_steps=max_steps if max_steps > 0 else -1,\n330\t        warmup_ratio=args.warmup_ratio,\n331\t        weight_decay=args.weight_decay,\n332\t        bf16=use_bf16,\n333\t        logging_steps=args.logging_steps,\n334\t        eval_steps=args.eval_steps if eval_dataset else None,\n335\t        eval_strategy=\"steps\" if eval_dataset else \"no\",\n336\t        save_steps=args.save_steps,\n337\t        save_strategy=\"steps\",\n338\t        save_total_limit=args.save_total_limit,\n339\t        save_only_model=args.save_only_model,\n340\t        load_best_model_at_end=eval_dataset is not None,\n341\t        metric_for_best_model=\"eval_loss\" if eval_dataset else None,\n342\t        report_to=report_to if report_to else \"none\",\n343\t        seed=args.seed,\n344\t        dataloader_drop_last=True,\n345\t        remove_unused_columns=False,\n346\t    )\n347\t\n348\t    trainer = WeightedTrainer(\n349\t        weighting_method=args.weighting_method,\n350\t        tau=args.tau,\n351\t        n_min=args.n_min,\n352\t        grid_b_value=args.grid_b_value,\n353\t        log_path=log_path,\n354\t        model=model,\n355\t        args=training_args,\n356\t        train_dataset=train_dataset,\n357\t        eval_dataset=eval_dataset,\n358\t        data_collator=collate_fn,\n359\t        tokenizer=tokenizer,\n360\t    )\n361\t\n362\t    config_summary = {\n363\t        \"model_name\": args.model_name,\n364\t        \"weighting_method\": args.weighting_method,\n365\t        \"grid_b_value\": args.grid_b_value if args.weighting_method == \"grid\" else None,\n366\t        \"tau\": args.tau,\n367\t        \"n_min\": args.n_min,\n368\t        \"contamination_ratio\": args.contamination_ratio,\n369\t        \"batch_size\": args.batch_size,\n370\t        \"learning_rate\": args.learning_rate,\n371\t        \"max_steps\": max_steps,\n372\t        \"seed\": args.seed,\n373\t        \"num_examples\": len(train_dataset),\n374\t    }\n375\t    print(\"\\n=== Training Config ===\")\n376\t    for k, v in config_summary.items():\n377\t        print(f\"  {k}: {v}\")\n378\t    print()\n379\t\n380\t    os.makedirs(args.output_dir, exist_ok=True)\n381\t    with open(os.path.join(args.output_dir, \"config.json\"), \"w\") as f:\n382\t        json.dump(config_summary, f, indent=2)\n383\t\n384\t    trainer.train(resume_from_checkpoint=args.resume_from_checkpoint)\n385\t    trainer._flush_metrics()\n386\t    trainer.save_model(os.path.join(args.output_dir, \"final\"))\n387\t    print(f\"\\nTraining complete. Model saved to {args.output_dir}/final\")\n388\t\n389\t\n390\tif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n391\t    main()\n392\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01N717tbwdPwznU9ZdsPCa4e","session_id":"5659f699-0e1d-4903-a3c6-9903938af801","uuid":"1ebab8f4-020c-47d4-b0ed-bc76be76157d","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:21:42.773Z"}
